  "version": "1.0",
  "tag": "",
  "description": "Section 3 of the MOH 731 Ver. July 2023 form, disaggregated across the columns the form's boxes are cut on. It is not what the report reads - the report has its own flat aggregation - it exists so a box can be drilled into: the patient list generator turns a dc__ indicator naming these columns into a filter on the shared base.",
